    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Ella Dunphy are delighted to present to the market this rare opportunity to purchase this prime c.2.27-acre site subject to Full Planning Permission. The site itself is surrounded by both road & countryside, while the boundaries is lined by trees and hedgerow. Ideally located within minutes of the M9 Motorway linking Waterford, Kilkenny, Carlow and Dublin. This site offers the discerning purchaser endless potential in wonderful rural setting.\n\nDirections\n\nFrom M9 Motorway take exit 11 at Mullinavat continue onto the R704 after 4km turn left at sign for “Saint Moling's Well”. Drive for 300m and the site will be located on the right indicated by “For Sale\" board.\n\nGPS Coordinates: 52.65970, -7.628899\n\nDistances \n\n• M9 Motorway - 6km \n• New Ross - 15km\n• Mullinavat 8km\n• Tullogher 6km"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Freehold site comprising c. 2.27 acres.</li><li> Contained on Folio KK12270.</li><li> Immense Potential with a peaceful setting.</li><li> Sweeping views of the rolling countryside.</li><li> Ideally located just minutes from the M9 Motorway.</ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Ciaran Dunphy"
      }
    ],
